Title: MasterChef: John Torode subject of racist language allegation in report
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'John Torode', 'Text': 'For the sake of transparency, I confirm that I am the individual who is alleged to have used racial language on one occasion.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 23, 'EndChar': 120}}, {'Speaker': 'John Torode', 'Text': 'person I was speaking with did not believe that it was intended in a malicious way and that I apologised immediately afterwards', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 27, 'EndChar': 124}}, {'Speaker': 'John Torode', 'Text': 'I have absolutely no recollection of any of this, and I do not believe that it happened,', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 2, 'EndChar': 75}}, {'Speaker': 'John Torode', 'Text': "However, I want to be clear that I've always had the view that any racial language is wholly unacceptable in any environment. I'm shocked and saddened by the allegation as I would never wish to cause anyone any offence.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 2, 'EndChar': 183}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'MasterChef presenter John Torode has said he is subject to an allegation of using racist language, upheld as part of an inquiry into separate allegations against co-host Gregg Wallace.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 148}}, {'Description': 'In an Instagram post on Monday, Torode said the allegation was that he made the remarks in 2018 or 2019 and that he had apologised immediately afterwards.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 143}}, {'Description': 'However, the TV chef said he had "no recollection" of any of it, adding: "I do not believe that it happened."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 97}}, {'Description': 'In his statement, Torode said: "For the sake of transparency, I confirm that I am the individual who is alleged to have used racial language on one occasion.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 119}}, {'Description': 'He added that the allegation included that the "person I was speaking with did not believe that it was intended in a malicious way and that I apologised immediately afterwards".', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 7, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 125}}, {'Description': '"I have absolutely no recollection of any of this, and I do not believe that it happened," he said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 8, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 76}}, {'Description': '"However, I want to be clear that I\'ve always had the view that any racial language is wholly unacceptable in any environment. I\'m shocked and saddened by the allegation as I would never wish to cause anyone any offence."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 9, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 184}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'John Torode'}]}
